      "pText": "Jager is built from two round towers shaped like barrels, joined by a rope net bridge. Red tube slides come down from the towers, and a net climber gives a second way up. Children run across the bridge, climb and slide out again, so play keeps moving between the two barrels. It takes 40 to 45 children. The product area is 34' x 27'7\" and the safe play area is 40' x 33'7\". A park, a township garden or a large school ground has room for it. Skills listed are exploring, confidence, social skills and critical thinking. Jager is part of our NexLev Solitaire series and comes in mixed colours. Its warranty runs 3 years on galvanised pipes, roto-moulded tube slides, composite laminates and play rope. Call us on +91 902 830 2266 to plan the space."
